BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 50 760 Td (Sleep Deprivation and Memory Consolidation in Adults) Tj T* (Abstract) Tj T* (We examined how one night of total sleep deprivation affects next-day recall) Tj T* (in a randomised crossover study of 40 healthy adults aged 18 to 35 years.) Tj T* (Introduction) Tj T* (Sleep is thought to support the consolidation of declarative memories, but) Tj T* (the size of the effect in adults remains debated across laboratory studies.) Tj T* ET
endstream
endobj
